### ============================================================
### AUTH SERVICE ROUTES (via Gateway: /auth/*)
### ============================================================

### Register Customer via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gateway_customer",
  "email": "gateway@smartship.com",
  "password": "Gateway@123"
}

###

### Register Admin via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "gateway_admin",
  "email": "admin@smartship.com",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

### Login via Gateway - Get Token
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ranjannilesh40@gmail.com",
  "password": "2004@Nilu"
}

###

### Login Admin via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@smartship.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}


###

### Refresh Token via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/auth/refresh?token={{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Revoke Token via Gateway
POST {{gateway}}/auth/revoke?token={{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Users via Gateway (ADMIN only)
GET {{gateway}}/auth/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update User Role via Gateway (ADMIN only)
PUT {{gateway}}/auth/admin/users/{{sample_user_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

###

