### ============================================================
### SHIPMENT SERVICE ROUTES (via Gateway: /shipments/*)
### ============================================================

### Create Shipment via Gateway (CUSTOMER only)
POST {{gateway}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderName": "Gateway Sender",
  "senderAddress": "789 Bridge St, Boston, MA 02101",
  "senderPhone": "+1-555-7890",
  "recipientName": "Gateway Recipient",
  "recipientAddress": "321 Harbor Ave, Seattle, WA 98101",
  "recipientPhone": "+1-555-9999",
  "itemDescription": "Gateway Test Package",
  "weight": 3.0,
  "dimensions": "35x25x20 cm",
  "estimatedValue": 750.00,
  "serviceType": "OVERNIGHT"
}

###

### Get My Shipments via Gateway (CUSTOMER)
GET {{gateway}}/shipments/my
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Specific Shipment via Gateway (CUSTOMER - own, ADMIN - any)
GET {{gateway}}/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Book Shipment via Gateway (CUSTOMER only)
PUT {{gateway}}/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}/book
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Cancel Shipment via Gateway (CUSTOMER only)
DELETE {{gateway}}/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get All Shipments via Gateway (ADMIN only)
GET {{gateway}}/shipments/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update Shipment Status via Gateway (ADMIN only)
PUT {{gateway}}/shipments/{{sample_shipment_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY"
}

###

